{
  "contentId": "1299382129",
  "title": "胎儿性别鉴定",
  "body": "<table data-bordercolor=\"#cccccc\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-be16fad6-2b13-415f-ab3b-27d31abab8ff\"><tbody><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-R7IsS8wW\"><th data-colwidth=\"176\" width=\"176\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-d78d355b-9729-43c1-a78d-e5aa49d4fed2\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-2ca9e98e-03a0-47a2-9fc8-7ad9fefa847f\">风险点</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"185\" width=\"185\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-0e93f7bb-e708-4011-bebb-acf3c0fd5d51\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-bcb402ed-ae5d-49e3-ab19-52d3419ffe48\">标准范围</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"310\" width=\"310\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-422ab3aa-1a28-403c-9ecd-397ae85529da\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-11c00b68-e398-4a0e-ad81-5fdc381cde88\">标准细则</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"845\" width=\"845\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-29953eda-548b-4e5b-ac1b-382d89aa2965\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-0d46d27c-de44-45e6-96b5-9b310d99e2d7\">打击案例</p></th></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-IQGDlguE\"><td rowspan=\"5\" data-colwidth=\"176\" width=\"176\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-291cc890-5dea-43df-81f0-e7149a000393\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-fd67a112-7e8c-4bf2-b85f-4b8c9300ff81\">胎儿性别鉴定</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"185\" width=\"185\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-595f6581-375f-4a7b-a8a9-a19800bbcbbc\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-03ea2c08-af15-422d-9310-4de6966a267f\"><span style=\"color: \">点评评论业务</span></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"310\" width=\"310\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-26468dec-82be-4341-9617-2c664e0b4d37\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-eee231d8-4922-49d7-af3b-4dd353ab1f3e\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-nKK6UzrP\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-2590a261-b488-4156-9674-758bda1f1da1\">明确或暗示的胎儿性别鉴定内容均需标星（人审放过）</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"845\" width=\"845\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-d513f87c-a90f-42a4-899a-9f38881d1f6f\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-c836614d-c7d9-4d9f-a3b6-9518b6c81d82\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-PV3RsO7b\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ba26a2c7-4cf0-4921-a631-1a8637344050\"><span style=\"color: \">非常有耐心 全程跟你讲解 还会暗示宝宝是***还是***～ 很准哦～ 很满意。</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-aBBM3jl9\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-37505b5d-dd0a-46ec-a181-b19011a53d7a\"><span style=\"color: \">知道**后还是比较激动的哈哈，这样可以准备后面的东西了</span></p></li></ul></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-9EBVSfih\"><td rowspan=\"4\" data-colwidth=\"185\" width=\"185\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-65d4fa3c-ede0-402d-810d-5f577702dbd6\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-9bc95f15-b340-4c61-b51a-87c02e1407b8\"><span style=\"color: \">点评评论以外的其他业务业务</span></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"310\" width=\"310\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-9d4dfd66-7695-4b6f-b635-8fd2ddc46f88\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-bd387d2c-aca1-4f64-be10-75b4b9007857\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-EH0Nr99G\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-c3743a7c-5fed-4ee6-8967-f83298393768\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">明确出现胎儿性别鉴定的内容需打击</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"845\" width=\"845\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-87c99429-75db-4714-b39f-16167d14bbd7\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-7986edba-66bf-42d8-8ffc-375f2643fe08\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-GgonLNVt\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-e52026e4-d48b-433b-b496-0399e20ad9da\"><span style=\"color: \">四维彩超（性别鉴定）、香港胎儿性别测定、怀孕42天测胎儿性别、胎儿性别测试卡、</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">成都查男女、</span>如何从彩超单看胎儿性别、<span style=\"color: \">七周验血男女准吗</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-t89QzAsi\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-eddac4ee-4c27-4daa-a400-295d1cd759bd\"><span style=\"color: \">[问题]:你好，我想照宝宝性别，可以吗？&lt;br&gt;[回答]:可以</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-K1h8zuT8\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-5ed7271d-6f03-4803-b308-e1ecc11e6f4f\"><span style=\"color: \">店家很专业，服务态度也很好。拍的是男宝宝，最后准了</span></p></li></ul></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-Ir7aemew\"><td data-colwidth=\"310\" width=\"310\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-4c84f515-30df-4993-b707-78c101b24c9c\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-5410db08-3e93-4dd2-9cb3-726e6fbaca91\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-c1MDEdcS\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-e3d9202b-6502-40df-aa78-6691f6840ec9\">暗示胎儿性别鉴定服务或性别鉴定结果的需打击</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"845\" width=\"845\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-3db59450-f8e5-43a0-94df-8eaa891f3a59\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-04b945f2-84a6-44a5-9718-3bcfbef5c6ee\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-TZiIWWtl\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-bfc9c0fd-489e-4fae-a36d-d9ea08be33c6\"><span style=\"color: \">去拍的四维彩超，很专业也很有耐心，不只是拍了宝宝的小脸儿，还指导我们看了孩子的各个部位是否健全什么的，还告知了胎儿在这个月龄的发育情况是否，最后还送了</span><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">蓝色</span><span style=\"color: \">的口水巾。</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-JAF9zKsA\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-29890795-f5cd-4f4a-b107-b8b7711b3738\"><span style=\"color: \">跟你一样，给的也是</span><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">蓝</span><span style=\"color: \">框框[呲牙]</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-Be2a1GUq\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-3cacc24a-6b00-4720-8ccd-90cb32df6a13\"><span style=\"color: \">拍完会跟你说的[偷笑]这是他们家电话，你可以问问150XXXXXXX</span></p></li></ul></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-JVI7UZeT\"><td data-colwidth=\"310\" width=\"310\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-b691b039-23d9-4a8b-8812-66f0d8b3097b\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-3541fe78-282e-411d-8836-a17d633889cb\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-guKWQRq4\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-a0f420be-49a2-4b2a-9249-603c4951b65d\"><span style=\"color: \">暗示胎儿性别的四维彩超图需打击</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-7aa0d595-42b8-4feb-a403-3c9679a888c4\"><strong>适用场景</strong>：四维彩超图<br><strong>适用场景</strong>：<span style=\"color: #f5232d\">颜色物品，婴儿出生后可识别婴儿性别的相关物品（疫苗接种证、红袜子蓝袜子等）</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-1e403d59-28df-4e7e-845c-a297c17312d0\"></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"845\" width=\"845\" class=\"overflow\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-e6fec527-ef18-4d65-b89f-cd4b532d9549\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-e5c91ac7-7bc1-46a4-93d0-58732c2bd6ea\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 162px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1299382129/1709824643?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1299382129/1709694747?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1299382129/1709599782?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"162\" data-height=\"122\"></span><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 72px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1299382129/1709732995?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1299382129/1709694612?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1299382129/1709599691?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"72\" data-height=\"128\"></span><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 253px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1299382129/1709694614?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1299382129/1709599692?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1299382129/1709694748?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"253\" data-height=\"114\"></span><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 156px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1299382129/1709824644?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1299382129/1709694667?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1299382129/1709844306?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"156\" data-height=\"117\"></span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-5365e6bc-eef4-4424-98b6-923de79320fa\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 719px\"><img alt=\"image.jpeg\" data-origin=\"\" data-small=\"\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1299382129/1710073479?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"719\" data-height=\"506\"></span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-d2682613-541a-4887-9fce-07674c7af251\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 776px\"><img alt=\"image.jpeg\" data-origin=\"\" data-small=\"\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1299382129/1710200999?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"776\" data-height=\"574\"></span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-9e1cc71d-195c-4ec5-98b3-0defce13e76c\"></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-1b0bad5a-7b2e-47f4-8ef7-f24de7d52894\"></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-906f8342-c441-4170-b35f-573c9b158399\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-c5N8NjcC\"><td data-colwidth=\"31