tps://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1299382129/1709844308?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"196\" data-height=\"187\"></span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-5d8f6a42-7efd-4dcd-8939-177385fd9f6b\"></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-6adbae46-b054-4254-9a7f-d045c66136b7\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 1181px\"><img alt=\"image.jpeg\" data-origin=\"\" data-small=\"\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1299382129/1710095057?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"828\" data-height=\"421\"></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-bea75bf8-990b-46e5-826b-6e8ac75a5c7f\"></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-98c6be90-1616-4169-966d-6b12d4b9c763\"></p>",
